  "body": "This refactors state machines describing reading of tag names, attributes and DOCTYPE tokens in order to simplify understanding of states described in the specification and corresponding state machine implementation by reducing number of duplicative actions.\n\nEach commit contains changes to a particular subject, and contains link to relevant commit in fork of [parse5](https://github.com/RReverser/parse5/tree/html-patch) HTML parser that contains suggested changes in tokenizer code in order to prove that changes work as intended and to show off code simplifications on a real-world well-tested implementation.\n",
